== Research Interests
My research group and I concentrate on optimization for power systems, including following topics:
- Power Systems, with offshore wind power optimization
- Transportation Network, with electric vehicles

== Recent News
- 2024.9.1, I began my Ph.D. journey at Tinghua University.
- 2023.6.30, I graduated from National University of Singaore with an outstanding master's thesis.

